n) is still the next step, unchanged from 2026-09-10 below. Full suite: 630 passed / 6 skipped (one `test_tier_a_features.py` MemoryError on the first full run was a genuine transient memory-pressure flake on this 16GB machine, unrelated â€” clean on immediate re-run and in isolation).

