- Multi-signal agreement = confidence: Coast 2 Coast + Sapian both hit 0.85 on bass_entry when RB chorus phrase + librosa bass rise + PWV5 height rise all align in one 8-bar window
- Codex's "interpretation lives separately from observations" pattern made the codebase dramatically more honest â€” Interval stores facts, CueCandidate stores interpretations, transition planner consumes ranked candidates
